[02:05.37]And I won't be surprised if it's a dream
[02:11.06]就算这一切是梦 我也不会惊奇
[02:11.06]Everything I want the world to be
[02:15.33]这世界 如我想要的那般光影
[02:15.33]Is now coming true especially for me
[02:20.27]仿佛专门为我而幻化成了实境
[02:20.27]And the reason is clear
[02:22.53]这原因显而易见
[02:22.53]It's because you are here
[02:25.22]都是因为你的存在
[02:25.22]You're the nearest thing to heaven that I've seen
